  ```
  Used in 3 of 5 entries. No bare "todo/later/future" language elsewhere — blockquote is only forward-looking signal.

  ## Open questions for next batch
  1. Entry id `roster-reference` (used) vs `roster` (user's first-batch spec) — design §2 entry 9 used `roster-reference`
  2. Quiz scenarios: nicknames vs ids — recommend ids (matches `paradigm agent list` output)
  3. Sequencing: `N-para-451-what-is-an-agent` (entry 2 in dep graph, skipped this batch) — author next or after partners deep-dive?

  ## Constraints honored
